From fea6364ee3704a8f88db27ae83793aed4637db88 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 2 Jul 2026 23:40:54 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 4/7] feat(uc-compat): functions with byte-fidelity spec
 round-trip

Add uc_function entity storing the client's function_info verbatim as
JSONB so routine_definition, parameter type metadata and properties
survive byte-identically (the unitycatalog-ai execution contract).
CatalogFunctionAction authorization with Execute relation in OpenFGA,
UC-compatible /functions endpoints (create/list/get/delete, no PATCH
per spec), and permission management endpoints.
